## Tech Stack

- **Python** — data processing, curve fitting, simulation
- **PicoHarp 300** — TCSPC acquisition hardware
- **NumPy / SciPy / Matplotlib** — numerical analysis and visualization

## Results

- Mapped boost/quench behavior across 20 field-angle/temperature combinations and 18 field strengths per orientation
- Resolved magnetic anisotropy in tetracene across three perpendicular field orientations
- Reproduced field-dependent fluorescence behavior in simulation, benchmarked against Merrifield and Swenberg models

